           StripOnInput->False]},
         {
          ItemBox[
           PaneBox[
            
            StyleBox["\<\"RegistrationTarget is an option for \
RegisterDiffusionData and RegisterCardiacData. Specifies which target to uses \
for registration if using \\\"rigid\\\", \\\"affine\\\" or \\\"bspline\\\" as \
